        "id": "ThreshQ",
        "name": "Death Sentence",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Thresh binds an enemy in chains and pulls them toward him. Activating this ability a second time pulls Thresh to the enemy.",
        "bodyHtml": "Thresh throws out his scythe, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Stunning</span> the first unit hit and <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Pulling</span> them towards Thresh for 1.5 seconds. The scythe does <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(100/150/200/250/300 + ([[si:scaleap]]90% Ability Power)) magic damage</span> and also grants <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 font-semibold\">True Sight</span> for the duration.<br /><br />Thresh can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this Ability to pull himself to the enemy.<br /><br />If this Ability hits, its Cooldown is reduced by 2 seconds.",
