        "slot": "W",
        "id": "ThreshW",
        "name": "Dark Passage",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Thresh throws out a lantern that shields nearby allied Champions from damage. Allies can click the lantern to dash to Thresh.",
        "bodyHtml": "Thresh throws his lantern, allowing an ally to click on it to dash to Thresh.<br /><br />The lantern also grants <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">52/72/92/112/132 Shield</span> for 4 seconds to Thresh and the first ally champion to come in contact with it.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-300\">Shield</span> scales with number of <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Souls</span> collected. Thresh can use his lantern to pick up <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Souls</span>.</span>",
