      "E": {
        "slot": "E",
        "id": "ThreshE",
        "name": "Flay",
        "maxRank": 5,
        "summary": "Thresh's attacks wind up, dealing more damage the longer he waits between attacks. When activated, Thresh sweeps his chain, knocking all enemies hit in the direction of the blow.",
        "bodyHtml": "<span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-500 italic\">Passive:</span> Thresh's Attacks deal additional damage based on how long since he last Attacked. They deal between <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">1.7</span> and <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(1.7 + ([[si:scalead]]90/120/150/180/210% Attack Damage)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-900 dark:text-white font-semibold\">Active:</span> Thresh whips his chains, <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Pulling</span> or <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Pushing</span> enemies in the direction of the swing. Enemies hit are also <span class=\"text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-500\">Slowed</span> by 20/25/30/35/40% for 1 second and take <span class=\"text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-500 font-semibold\">(65/110/155/200/245 + ([[si:scaleap]]60% Ability Power)) magic damage</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Passive damage scales with number of <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Souls</span> collected.</span>",
